<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Boyband</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">5 Seconds of Summer</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">EVERYONE'S A STAR! (Fully Evolved)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0JjditZewN27ych0vvmWXT</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.713" end="00:04.717">Boy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:04.717" end="00:07.176">Boy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.176" end="00:08.735">I'm your favourite</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.735" end="00:11.215">Boy, boy, boy, boy, boy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.215" end="00:12.779">I'm your favourite</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.779" end="00:15.424">Boy, boy, boy, boy, boy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.424" end="00:16.924" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.670" end="00:20.655">Give me, give me, give me, give me everything I want</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.655" end="00:24.700">Take my photograph and lick it with a wet tongue</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.700" end="00:28.396">When I'm dead and gone, then bury me in stardust</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.396" end="00:33.171">King of the river city, look at what it gave us, uh-huh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.171" end="00:34.671" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.221" end="00:37.120">Raised on pop punk and bubble gum</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.120" end="00:41.162">Stay young, love me till I get it wrong</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.162" end="00:44.155">Make me the flavour of the week</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.155" end="00:47.190">Now I only feel alive when you're looking at me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.190" end="00:55.175">I'm your favourite boy, boy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.175" end="00:56.675">I'm your favourite</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.632" end="00:58.132" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.682" end="01:00.675">Boy in a boyband, imaginary boyfriend</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.675" end="01:04.696">Irritates the metalheads, it's your favourite boyband</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.696" end="01:08.676">Boy in a boyband, make that monkey dance</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.676" end="01:12.589">Let me see you clap your hands, it's your favourite boyband</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.589" end="01:14.089" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.668" end="01:16.551">Give you, give you, give you, give you everything you want</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.551" end="01:20.608">See me on the telly every time you turn it on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.608" end="01:24.535">Love me when I'm skinny and we never, ever age</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.535" end="01:29.166">Same four chords, but it never feels the same, uh-huh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.166" end="01:30.666" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.216" end="01:33.052">Raised on pop punk and bubble gum</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.052" end="01:37.147">Stay young, love me till I get it wrong</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.147" end="01:40.164">Make me the flavour of the week</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.164" end="01:43.169">Now I only feel alive when you're looking at me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.169" end="01:44.669">I'm your favourite</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.657" end="01:46.157" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.707" end="01:48.575">Boy in a boyband, imaginary boyfriend</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.575" end="01:52.694">Irritates the metalheads, it's your favourite boyband</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.694" end="01:56.710">Boy in a boyband, make that monkey dance</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.710" end="02:00.543">Let me see you clap your hands, it's your favourite boyband</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.543" end="02:07.711" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.711" end="02:15.435">It's your favourite</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.435" end="02:16.935">Your favourite</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.688" end="02:20.702">Boy in a boyband, make that monkey dance</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.702" end="02:24.699">Make that monkey dance, make that monkey dance</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.699" end="02:28.687">Boy in a boyband, make that monkey dance</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.687" end="02:32.562">Make that monkey dance, make that monkey dance</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.562" end="02:34.062" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.682" end="02:36.657">Boy in a boyband, imaginary boyfriend</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.657" end="02:40.696">Irritates the metalheads, it's your favourite boyband</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.696" end="02:44.695">Boy in a boyband, make that monkey dance</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.695" end="02:48.695">Let me see you clap your hands, it's your favourite boyband</p></div></body></tt>